{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"23705","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v19493","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"真木八尋","creatorId":"vndb:s3350","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:78","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3350","name":"真木八尋","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:166059","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"永山侠摩","creatorId":"vndb:s9560","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:27230","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9560","name":"永山侠摩","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:166060","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"でそ","creatorId":"egs:creator:22991","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:22991","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:22991","name":"でそ","detail":"グラフィック","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:166731","source":"egs"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c48059","characterName":"橘 渚","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c48059"},"originalCharacterName":"橘 渚","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A transfer student with a cool aura, raised by her father. She is beautiful, with fast reflexes. She is strong, as she has been training martial arts, since little. She became a legend, when she had to change schools, because she single-handedly beat up the delinquent boss at her previous school. Meeting with you, her personality changes, as she experiences kindness."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day, while she was walking down the street, she saves the Protagonist from some scum. The next day, she joined his school as a transferred student and landed in his class. She is approached by him because he wants to thank her and, over time, they realize that they are childhood friends, fall in love and eventually become a couple."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After a stinging defeat against her opponent, Nagisa is forced by Juri to have sex with her attackers in exchange for leaving the protagonist alone. Only, after a while, Nagisa's remorse for having offered her first time to a tramp and cheating on her boyfriend becomes obvious and the protagonist notices that she is not doing well."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She answers that all is well and cut the conversation. Making the connection between his \"quiet life\" and the behavior of Nagisa, the protagonist goes to a warehouse, where his attackers have given him an appointment. He meets Nagisa who begs him to leave, but it is already too late and Nagisa is gang raped in front of the protagonist who is also raped by Juri."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Nagisa eventually gets pregnant with one of her attackers, probably as a result of her gang rape in the warehouse. After that, they are no longer blackmailed but the protagonist is depressed, no longer has any contact with Nagisa (but they are still in a relationship) because he is shut on himself and he gets knocked on the road by a car. He wakes up a few times later and realizes that he is being raped by a pregnant Nagisa, who keeps saying that she has been waiting for this for a long time. The protagonist resigns himself, and finally accepts his destiny and that all his life is and will forever be a completely chaotic life."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c48059"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/18/180f41dc7f13d7a22aef0e92efd1ce6d55fae5257ec796a4758d5552313c6b2d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1538507825ddfeb9c52d2667406bca2d4cb1c4df6add811e5317fc5811c62ba.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"霧賀 みね","creatorId":"vndb:s2001","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2001","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2001","name":"早崎 千香子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:69728","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c48060","characterName":"樹里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c48060"},"originalCharacterName":"樹里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kabashima's girlfriend. With a cunning personality, she is willing to use her body for her needs. She loves sex. Wanting money, she often engages in compensated dating. For her entertainment, it doesn't matter how cruel she is. With what kind of poison fang does she try and get you!?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c48060"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fdd798a1aa8a55717635f3dffe6e12d57566fe17e2eba0ae91b3bea42e757a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/215588245962499d9e6fe31635d656a92f6498e55ebfa4fa3ca9f86cefbc279c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c76722","characterName":"主人公","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c76722"},"originalCharacterName":"主人公","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"While being assaulted, he is saved by a mysterious girl. The next day, a transferred student is introduced to the class, which is none other than the mysterious girl named Nagisa. The protagonist gets closer to her for the thank you and, by the way, they get closer, he learns that in fact they are childhood friends and finally go out together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Only one day, the protagonist notices that his aggressors no longer annoy him, that Nagisa acts oddly, she looks unhappy as if she were going to cry every time their eyes crossed. He finds that the situation becomes to be strange..."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After a while, the protagonist asks to Nagisa what's going on but she answers that all is well and cut the conversation. Making the connection between his \"quiet life\" and the behavior of Nagisa, the protagonist goes to a warehouse, where his ex-attackers have given him an appointment. He meets Nagisa who begs him to leave, but it is already too late and Nagisa is gang raped in front of the protagonist who is also raped by Juri."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Nagisa eventually gets pregnant with one of her attackers, probably as a result of her gang rape in the warehouse. After that, they are no longer blackmailed but the protagonist is depressed, no longer has any contact with Nagisa (but they are still in a relationship) because he is shut on himself and he gets knocked on the road by a car. He wakes up a few times later and realizes that he is being raped by a pregnant Nagisa, who keeps saying that she has been waiting for this for a long time. The protagonist resigns himself, and finally accepts his destiny and that all his life is and will forever be a completely chaotic life."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c76722"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36b5aaf75311d28860df4c02afbdfc061ca78dd0e3d8334f9775a8f7f76bb4ba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5c452e79e13fffa9abe993c0ee793ab1dc02d28e7d495d1c6f7a8919746d5b9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c85333","characterName":"椛島","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c85333"},"originalCharacterName":"椛島","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e9a7868a968a2dc199b6b5a58bfcf167f57db0890812dfc99026265b2968104.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a90acd2136a564b10eeeea8f1f08de1f3d9d35d61f88a7443066ac1d9b59181.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c85334","characterName":"前釜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c85334"},"originalCharacterName":"前釜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1cd65997c005492ce965a9e1a944957b90dcdf140fa3b6e01391e1a49f7dc0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26dacac4ea92ea32bf